{# Base for every folio page scoped to a single Row/document: detail, item_chat, page_chat, ai
   (OCR/handwriting). Wires the `row` menu option ONCE so a PAGE_ACTIONS listener (Bookmark, Edit,
   OCR, Ask document, ...) can render consistently across all of them, instead of each page's hero
   re-implementing its own action buttons — see Survos\FolioBundle\Menu\RowMenu.

   Just `row` — Row::getRp() already derives provider/dataset/coreCode/dtoType/localId from the
   row itself, so there's no need to separately pass (or require every calling template to have)
   provider/dataset in scope. provider is dataset metadata, not part of a row's identity. #}
{% extends app.request.attributes.get('_layout')|default(folio_base_template()) %}

{% do tabler_menu_options({
    core: row.core,
    folio: row.core.folio,
    row: row}, _self) %}
